{"id":"P049-2","subject":"P","unit":"P049","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P049-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\nIGBT에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 게이트 전압으로 동작시키는 전압제어 소자이다.\n\n② 넓은 동작 전압범위를 갖는다.\n\n③ 에미터와 컬렉터 사이의 전압강하가 크다.\n\n④ 다수의 소자의 병렬연결이 용이하다.\n\n⑤ 스위칭 속도가 빠르다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":388},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1022}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n저항 40Ω, 리액턴스 24Ω이 병렬로 연결되어 있는\n\n회로에 240V의 전압을 걸었을 때, 회로의 전전류A 는?\n\n\n①         ② \n\n                                 \n③         ④  \n\n         \n⑤  ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":860}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 6의 소비전력W은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 60          ② 90\n\n③ 120         ④ 150\n\n⑤ 180","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":749},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1459}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n도선의 저항률을 , 지름을 라고 할 때, 도선의 저항은\n\n어떻게 표현되는가?\n\n\n                                   \n①            ②                           \n\n                                                  \n③            ④           \n\n           \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":537},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m29-e1.webp","width":678,"height":423}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n5000/200V, 10kVA  단상변압기 1차측에 500V를\n\n인가하였을 때, 2차측 단락전류가 250A이다.\n\n이 변압기의 %임피던스는?\n\n\n\n\n① 2           ② 5\n\n③ 10          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 25","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1458}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n어떤 회로의 저항과 리액턴스의 비가    일 때,               \n\n이 회로의 역률은?\n\n\n① 88          ② 90\n\n③ 92          ④ 94\n\n⑤ 96","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":714},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":424}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n코일에 흐르는 전류가 0.01초 동안 2A 에서 10A로\n\n변화할 때 코일의 유도 기전력이 20V였다.\n\n이 코일의 자기 인덕턴스는 몇 mH 인가\n\n\n① 10          ② 25\n\n③ 40          ④ 50\n\n⑤ 80","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":606},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":785}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n50mH 의 코일 두 개를 같은 방향으로 감아서 직렬로\n\n접속하는 경우 합성 인덕턴스가 140mH 였다.\n\n두 코일의 상호 인덕턴스mH 는?\n\n\n① 80          ② 60\n\n③ 40          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 10","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1097}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n다음 회로의 공진 주파수Hz로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n①            ②               \n③             ④               \n⑤            ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":789},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n임피던스 궤적이 4사분면(4상한)에서 반원으로 표현되는\n\n회로는?\n\n\n\n\n① RL직렬회로      ② RL병렬회로\n\n③ RC직렬회로      ④ RC병렬회로\n\n⑤ LC직렬회로","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":531},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 10Ω의 저항에 흐르는 전류의\n\n크기A 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④  \n\n    \n⑤  ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":804},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n3상 평형 부하를 Y결선으로 접속하였을 때, 3상 소비전력이\n\n300W였다. 부하 결선을 △결선으로 변경하는 경우,\n\n전력손실W은? (단, 전원 전압은 일정하다.)\n\n\n① 100         ② 200\n\n③ 300         ④ 600\n\n⑤ 900","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":604},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1087}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n평형 3상 선로에서 대칭분 , , 의 총 합은 어떻게\n\n표현되는가? (단, 는 상의 전압을 의미한다.)\n\n\n①            ② \n\n    ③            ④                                \n⑤        ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":475},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m38-e1.webp","width":678,"height":795},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m38-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1063}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P049-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n시간함수 의 라플라스 변환은?\n\n\n                       \n①            ②  \n                        \n③            ④  \n\n       \n⑤","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.24 서울에너지공사 (인크루트)","originalId":"2024h2-e08-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m39-q.webp","width":696,"height":1881},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e08-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":821}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
